JS INDEX

01 - TOGGLE SWITCHER PANEL
02 - LAYOUT WIDTH (WIDE OR BOXED)
03 - HEADER PREVIEW (FIXED OR STATIC)
04 - NAVIGATION WIDTH (WIDE OR BOXED)
05 - PATTERN BACKGROUND SWITCHER
